        <mxCell id="Bnote" value="The fallthrough is the point: null from the clear module is a handoff signal, not a failure.&lt;br&gt;A null from the move module would end in ActionRest, which is why that module never returns one." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="B1">
